    "doi": "10.64898/2026.11.06.764883",
    "date": "2026-11-09",
    "authors": "Robin-Champgneul, F. A., Singh, A., Sharma, S., Tkachenko, O., Thyr, J., Sidiropoulos, S., Schnurer, A., Zajkowski, T., Budnyak, T., Neubeck, A.",
